    "title": "LFC to perform magical comedy 'Puffs' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "24 minutes ago A wacky play based on an imaginative wizarding world titled “Puffs” might leave audiences with an unrelenting smile on their faces in Athens soon. Beginning Saturday, the Lost Flamingo Theatre Company, Ohio University's first student-run theater company, is performing its own production of “Puffs.” This will be the company’s second show of the semester, following “The Rocky Horror Picture Show” in October. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
